{
	"info": {
		"name": "Booking Lapangan Futsal API",
		"description": "RESTful API Manajemen Booking Lapangan Futsal / Mini Soccer (UTS KEPL - Gunael Alexander Silalahi - 544963).\n\nCara pakai:\n1. Di folder `backend/`, jalankan `php artisan migrate:fresh --seed` lalu `php artisan serve`.\n2. Jalankan request **Auth > Login**. Token otomatis disimpan ke variabel collection `token`.\n3. Semua request lain otomatis memakai Bearer Token `{{token}}`.\n4. **Booking > Tambah Booking** otomatis menyimpan `booking_id` untuk request tampil/ubah/hapus.",
		"schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
	},
	"auth": {
		"type": "bearer",
		"bearer": [
			{
				"key": "token",
				"value": "{{token}}",
				"type": "string"
			}
		]
	},
	"variable": [
		{
			"key": "base_url",
			"value": "http://127.0.0.1:8000/api",
			"type": "string"
		},
		{
			"key": "token",
			"value": "",
			"type": "string"
		},
		{
			"key": "booking_id",
			"value": "1",
			"type": "string"
		}
	],
	"item": [
		{
			"name": "Auth",
			"item": [
				{
					"name": "Login",
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"type": "text/javascript",
								"exec": [
									"pm.test('Status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
									"const body = pm.response.json();",
									"if (body.token) {",
									"    pm.collectionVariables.set('token', body.token);",
									"}"
								]
							}
						}
					],
					"request": {
						"auth": {
							"type": "noauth"
						},
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [
							{
								"key": "Accept",
								"value": "application/json"
							},
							{
								"key": "Content-Type",
								"value": "application/json"
							}
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n    \"email\": \"admin@futsal.test\",\n    \"password\": \"password\"\n}"
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{base_url}}/login",
							"host": ["{{base_url}}"],
							"path": ["login"]
						}
					}
				},
				{
					"name": "Login - Password Salah (422)",
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"type": "text/javascript",
								"exec": [
									"pm.test('Status 422', () => pm.response.to.have.status(422));"
								]
							}
						}
					],
					"request": {
						"auth": {
							"type": "noauth"
						},
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [
							{
								"key": "Accept",
								"value": "application/json"
							},
							{
								"key": "Content-Type",
								"value": "application/json"
							}
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n    \"email\": \"admin@futsal.test\",\n    \"password\": \"salah\"\n}"
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{base_url}}/login",
							"host": ["{{base_url}}"],
							"path": ["login"]
						}
					}
				},
				{
					"name": "Profil User (Me)",
					"request": {
						"method": "GET",
						"header": [
							{
								"key": "Accept",
								"value": "application/json"
							}
						],
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{base_url}}/me",
							"host": ["{{base_url}}"],
							"path": ["me"]
						}
					}
				}
			]
		},
